#, no-c-format
msgid "Volume"
msgstr "Lydstyrke"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Show the aiming crosshair and hide the mouse cursor,\n"
"for the light-gun titles (Virtua Cop 2, House of the\n"
"Dead, Gunblade NY, Rail Chase 2, Behind Enemy Lines)."
msgstr ""
"Vis sigtekornet og skjul musemarkøren til\n"
"lyspistolspillene (Virtua Cop 2, House of the\n"
"Dead, Gunblade NY, Rail Chase 2, Behind Enemy Lines)."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show crosshair"
msgstr "Vis sigtekorn"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Draw sm2-emu's own crosshair. Turn off if the gun\n"
"has its own sight (e.g. a Sinden). Positional-gun\n"
"titles always draw their own regardless."
msgstr ""
"Tegn sm2-emus eget sigtekorn. Slå fra, hvis pistolen\n"
"har sit eget sigte (f.eks. en Sinden). Spil med\n"
"positionspistol tegner altid deres eget alligevel."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide shot flash"
msgstr "Skjul skudglimt"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hide the white flash Virtua Cop, Virtua Cop 2 and\n"
"House of the Dead show on each shot."
msgstr ""
"Skjul det hvide glimt, som Virtua Cop, Virtua Cop 2 og\n"
"House of the Dead viser ved hvert skud."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Player 1 aims with the mouse; the left button fires and the right button "
"reloads (shoot off screen)."
msgstr ""
"Spiller 1 sigter med musen; venstre knap skyder, og højre knap lader om (skyd uden for skærmen)."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recoil"
msgstr "Rekyl"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kick the gun's rumble motor on each shot, for guns\n"
"that have one (Sinden and similar). No effect on a\n"
"gun without a motor."
msgstr ""
"Giv pistolens vibrationsmotor et stød ved hvert skud, til\n"
"pistoler, der har en (Sinden og lignende). Ingen effekt\n"
"på en pistol uden motor."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable recoil"
msgstr "Aktiver rekyl"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Styrke"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Enheder"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Gun %zu (player %zu): %s"
msgstr "Pistol %zu (spiller %zu): %s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No dedicated light guns detected. Player 1 aims with the mouse; the left "
"button fires and the right button reloads (shoot off screen). Plug in guns "
"in absolute mouse mode (GUN4IR, Sinden, AimTrak) before launching for "
"independent per-player aiming."
msgstr ""
"Ingen dedikerede lyspistoler fundet. Spiller 1 sigter med musen; venstre knap skyder, og højre knap lader om (skyd uden for skærmen). Tilslut pistoler i absolut musetilstand (GUN4IR, Sinden, AimTrak) før start for uafhængig sigtning pr. spiller."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No dedicated light guns detected. Player 1 aims with the mouse; the left "
"button fires and the right button reloads (shoot off screen). Plug in guns "
"tagged ID_INPUT_GUN for independent per-player aiming."
msgstr ""
"Ingen dedikerede lyspistoler fundet. Spiller 1 sigter med musen; venstre knap skyder, og højre knap lader om (skyd uden for skærmen). Tilslut pistoler mærket ID_INPUT_GUN for uafhængig sigtning pr. spiller."

