"For your own bookkeeping; the game negotiates the\n"
"actual link id from the ring."
msgstr ""
"Hvor dette kabinet sidder i ringen (fra 0).\n"
"Til din egen bogføring; spillet forhandler det\n"
"faktiske link-id via ringen."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
